---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | FARID MAHMOUDI" 
  description="Privacy Policy and Data Protection guidelines for Farid Mahmoudi's web engineering platform."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen py-16 px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-sans">
    
    {/* Sleek Minimalist Back Button */}
    <div class="mb-12">
      <a 
        href="/" 
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-white/5 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white hover:border-neutral-300 dark:hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm"
      >
        <span>Back to Home</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Document Header */}
    <div class="mb-12 border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-normal">
        Last updated: August 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Plain Readable Document Body */}
    <div class="space-y-10 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base font-light">
      
      {/* Section 1 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          1. Overview
        </h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to the website of Farid Mahmoudi. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you visit this platform or contact me regarding web development, workflow automation, or AI integration services.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 2 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          2. Information Collected
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website collects minimal information required to communicate and maintain functional preferences:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
          <li><strong class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-medium">Contact Information:</strong> Data voluntarily submitted through the contact form (such as name, email address, and project message).</li>
          <li><strong class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-medium">Local Storage:</strong> Appearance preferences (such as your Light or Dark mode toggle choice) saved locally in your browser's <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-white/10 font-sans text-xs text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">localStorage</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* Section 3 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          3. How Information Is Used
        </h2>
        <p>
          Information submitted is used strictly for professional communication:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
          <li>Responding to your project inquiries and service requests.</li>
          <li>Providing project estimates and updates.</li>
          <li>Maintaining security and preventing automated spam.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* Section 4 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          4. Data Security & Sharing
        </h2>
        <p>
          All communications use HTTPS encryption. Your personal information is never sold, rented, or shared with third parties for marketing purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 5 */}
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          5. Cookies
        </h2>
        <p>
          This site uses zero third-party tracking or advertising cookies. Browser local storage is strictly used for functional theme preferences.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 6 */}
      <section class="space-y-2 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          6. Contact
        </h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy questions or data deletion requests, feel free to reach out via the <a href="/contact" class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-medium underline underline-offset-4">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
